    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Firm Criteria" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add a Firm Criteria</p>
            <p>Verifies that a new firm criterion can be created with valid details.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Firm Criteria settings. 2. Click "Add" and fill in the name, related dropdowns, and selections. 3. Save the criterion.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The firm criterion should be successfully added.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
